OL,3,GNEWSALab equipment reuse firm hopes to
OL,4,Adeliver 120 jobs in old DHL depot
OL,5,
OL,6,FA green technology company that gives
OL,7,Funwanted laboratory equipment a second
OL,8,Flife hopes to create 120 jobs at a
OL,9,Fformer DHL depot in the south of
OL,10,FScotland.
OL,12,FUniGreenScheme has expanded into a new
OL,13,Frefurbishment centre on Irongray Road
OL,14,Fin Dumfries.
OL,16,FBacked by a #420,000 grant from South
OL,17,Fof Scotland Enterprise (SOSE), it hopes
OL,18,Fto create the jobs over the next 10
OL,19,Fyears.
